/- {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/components/discover-articles.lava' %} -/


<section class="mt-5">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
        <h4>Articles</h4>

        <a href="#">See All Articles</a>
    </div>

    <div class="article-pad bg-gray">
        <div class="row g g-5">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-xs-12">
                <div class="card card-transparent">
                    <img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/lcbc-assets/images/LivingWithLions_600x290-Horizontal.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h4 class="card-title"><a href="#" class="stretched-link">3 Things the Church Needs to be Built to Last</a></h4>
                        <span class="d-block card-subtitle"><span class="label label-primary">Faith</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="card-text text-sm">
                            <p>How do we keep the church from getting burn out by building something that lasts? Check out 3 things straight from Jesus in Matthew 25.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-xs-12">
                {% for i in (1..3) %}
                    <div class="card card-transparent">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h4 class="card-title"><a href="#" class="stretched-link">3 Things the Church Needs to be Built to Last</a></h4>
                            <span class="d-block card-subtitle"><span class="label label-primary">Faith</span></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="card-body">

                            <div class="card-text text-sm">
                                How do we keep the church from getting burn out by building something that lasts? Check out 3 things straight from Jesus in Matthew 25.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>
